#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:28
msgid ""
"Alcove is a GNOME-native manager for isolated web applications. WebKitGTK is "
"the default engine, and Chromium is available as a Flatpak add-on for "
"explicitly selected sites. Each website gets separate local data, cookies, "
"cache, settings, and its own desktop launcher."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:34
msgid ""
"Alcove is an independent successor to Spider. The original work by Zaedus, "
"Cameron Radmore's contribution, and their Git history remain credited. "
"Alcove is developed independently and does not claim their endorsement or "
"participation."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:41
msgid "Create, edit, repair, and remove portal-installed launchers"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:42
msgid ""
"Fetch and safely normalize website icons with an offline fallback; an "
"optional Icon Horse request is made only by explicit user action"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:43
msgid ""
"Keep each application's configuration, policy, profile, and cache separate"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:58
msgid ""
"Replace the library grid with an adaptive GNOME list, search, sorting, and "
"keyboard navigation"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:59
msgid ""
"Add a site-only Icon Horse favicon fallback with safe hostname checks, "
"cache, and PNG normalization"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:60
msgid ""
"Add accessible application details actions and explicit site-icon controls "
"for creation and editing"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:68
msgid ""
"Redesign the library as an adaptive card grid with search, sorting, and "
"application details"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:69
msgid ""
"Keep WebKitGTK as the default and make Chromium an optional, manually "
"installed add-on"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:70
msgid ""
"Add a trusted local Chromium toolbar built with secure WebContentsView "
"isolation"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:71
msgid ""
"Add explicit add-on diagnostics, restart guidance, and one-time WebKit "
"fallback"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:79
msgid "Move the Chromium payload from the main app into a Flatpak add-on"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:80
msgid "Publish the app and add-on together from the signed Alcove repository"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:81
msgid "Keep WebKitGTK usable when the Chromium add-on is not installed"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:82
msgid "Add clear installation and compatibility diagnostics for the add-on"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:90
msgid "Embed the Chromium engine into the single Alcove Flatpak"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:91
msgid "Remove the need to install or update a separate Chromium package"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:92
msgid "Keep WebKitGTK as the default and retain separate per-engine profiles"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:93
msgid ""
"Activate Chromium through an internal service owned by the Alcove app ID"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:94
msgid "Publish a GPG-signed project Flatpak repository for x86_64 and aarch64"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:95
msgid "Clarify the GPL-3.0-only license and preserved Spider authorship"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:103
msgid ""
"Add an explicit WebKitGTK or Chromium engine choice with local compatibility "
"recommendations"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:104
msgid ""
"Integrate the separately sandboxed Chromium companion through an "
"authenticated D-Bus protocol"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:105
msgid ""
"Keep engine profiles separate and safely retry deferred companion profile "
"cleanup"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:106
msgid ""
"Diagnose Dynamic Launcher, File Chooser, and Documents portal capabilities "
"independently"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:107
msgid ""
"Distinguish unavailable, unsupported, cancelled, denied, and failed portal "
"operations"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:115
msgid ""
"Add opt-in navigation allowlists, proxy settings, background mode, "
"autostart, and content filters"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:116
msgid ""
"Add a threat model for websites, profiles, portals, backups, and the future "
"companion boundary"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:117
msgid ""
"Keep every new privacy and power feature disabled until the user enables it"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:118
msgid ""
"Serialize portal reconciliation and safely merge concurrent policy edits"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:119
msgid ""
"Require fresh background authorization after restore while preserving other "
"policy"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:127
msgid ""
"Add versioned metadata backups with transactional per-application restore"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:128
msgid "Add optional passphrase-encrypted transfer of cookies and site storage"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:129
msgid ""
"Add conflict preview, partial-failure reporting, and runtime profile locks"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:130
msgid "Add portal capability diagnostics and native aarch64 release bundles"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:131
msgid ""
"Harden archive extraction, resource limits, and concurrent profile operations"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:139
msgid "Add per-origin website permissions with session and persistent choices"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:140
msgid ""
"Add popup and OAuth windows, native notifications, and managed downloads"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:141
msgid "Add navigation, zoom, and fullscreen runtime controls"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:142
msgid ""
"Migrate Alcove data to schema v2 and remove Spider runtime compatibility"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:150
msgid "Prevent a crash when opening an application card for editing"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:151
msgid "Add a headless regression test for editor state changes"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:159
msgid "Introduce the Alcove identity and isolated JSON-based storage"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.cheviiot.alcove.metainfo.xml.in:160
msgid "Add transactional launcher operations and repair support"
